nsumer coverage; no extra Maven dependency required since the uber-jar resolves its own transitives.\",\n            \"deterministic_setup\": [\n                {\n                    \"kind\": \"docker_image\",\n                    \"image\": \"apachepulsar/pulsar:4.2.5\",\n                    \"slug\": \"apachepulsar_pulsar\",\n                    \"reason\": \"pulsar-client-all is a network client; exercising producer/consumer/admin paths requires a running Pulsar broker, matching this repo's existing pattern for io.nats:jnats and com.rabbitmq.client:amqp-client. Tag 4.2.5 matches the library version exactly.\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"agent_guidance\": \"Start the container with `bin/pulsar standalone --no-functions-worker --no-stream-storage` to avoid starting the functions worker and BookKeeper-backed stream storage, which aren't needed for basic producer/consumer coverage and would otherwise slow startup. Expose ports 6650 (client serviceUrl `pulsar://localhost:6650`) and 8080 (admin HTTP, usable for readiness polling, e.g. GET /admin/v2/clusters). Pulsar standalone takes substantially longer to become ready than nats/rabbitmq (it boots a broker, bookie, and ZooKeeper in one JVM), so the test must poll/retry for readiness with a generous timeout rather than reuse the short fixed sleep pattern seen in JnatsTest. Tear down the container (docker kill/rm) after the test so repeated local runs don't leak containers.\",\n            \"risks\": [\n                \"Pulsar standalone's startup is slower and more resource-hungry than the other broker images already allow-listed (nats, rabbitmq), which may increase test wall-clock time and flakiness risk under constrained CI resources.\",\n                \"pulsar-client-all is a large shaded jar (~hundreds of MB transitively: netty, avro, protobuf, bouncycastle); native-image build time/memory could be heavier than typical libraries in this repo \\u2014 no specific blocking GraalVM issue was found during research, but local Gradle/native-image verification remains authoritative.\"\n            ],\n            \"applied_setup\": [\n                {\n                    \"kind\": \"docker_image\",\n                    \"image\": \"apachepulsar/pulsar:4.2.5\",\n                    \"slug\": \"apachepulsar_pulsar\",\n                    \"result\": \"already_present\",\n                    \"target\": \"tests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/allowed-docker-images/Dockerfile-apachepulsar_pulsar\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"input_evidence\": [\n                {\n                    \"name\": \"issue\",\n                    \"summary\": \"#10642 Support for org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-all:4.2.5; label=library-new-request; body_chars=61\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n                    \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n            \"input_tokens_used\": 34,\n            \"output_tokens_used\": 16603\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n            \"input_tokens_used\": 238368,\n            \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 2337664,\n            \"output_tokens_used\": 30021,\n            \"iterations\": 5,\n            \"cost_usd\": 3.2612,\n            \"generated_loc\": 0,\n            \"tested_library_loc\": 0,\n            \"metadata_entries\": 0,\n            \"code_coverage_percent\": 0.0\n        },\n        \"artifacts\": {\n            \"metadata_file\": \"None\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nPending metrics:\n{\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-13T23:14:15.696891Z\",\n    \"library\": \"org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-all:4.2.5\",\n    \"starting_commit\": \"2d5b385c3e0cb309fc85a3b03ac8b2f8cde5f14e\",\n    \"ending_commit\": \"ba2978302c66e69316ad6f0af2c55a53c66e2db0\",\n    \"strategy_name\": \"optimistic_dynamic_access_iterative_pi_gpt-5.6-sol\",\n    \"agent\": \"pi\",\n    \"mo