chemaInfo().getProperties()).containsEntry(\"domain\", \"audit\");\n    38\t        assertThat(decoded.getEventId()).isEqualTo(event.getEventId());\n    39\t        assertThat(decoded.getOccurredAt()).isEqualTo(event.getOccurredAt());\n    40\t        assertThat(decoded.getSeverity()).isEqualTo(event.getSeverity());\n    41\t    }\n    42\t\n    43\t    public static final class AuditEvent {\n    44\t        private String eventId;\n    45\t        private Instant occurredAt;\n    46\t        private int severity;\n    47\t\n    48\t        public AuditEvent() { }\n    49\t\n    50\t        public AuditEvent(String eventId, Instant occurredAt, int severity) {\n    51\t            this.eventId = eventId;\n    52\t            this.occurredAt = occurredAt;\n    53\t            this.severity = severity;\n    54\t        }\n    55\t\n    56\t        public String getEventId() {\n    57\t            return eventId;\n    58\t        }\n    59\t\n    60\t        public void setEventId(String eventId) {\n    61\t            this.eventId = eventId;\n    62\t        }\n    63\t\n    64\t        public Instant getOccurredAt() {\n    65\t            return occurredAt;\n    66\t        }\n    67\t\n    68\t        public void setOccurredAt(Instant occurredAt) {\n    69\t            this.occurredAt = occurredAt;\n    70\t        }\n    71\t\n    72\t        public int getSeverity() {\n    73\t            return severity;\n    74\t        }\n    75\t\n    76\t        public void setSeverity(int severity) {\n    77\t            this.severity = severity;\n    78\t        }\n    79\t    }\n    80\t}\n\n--- Pulsar test relevant ---\n     1\t/*\n     2\t * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n     3\t *\n     4\t * You should have received a copy of the CC0 legalcode along with this\n     5\t * work. If not, see <http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>.\n     6\t */\n     7\tpackage org_apache_pulsar.pulsar_client_all;\n     8\t\n     9\timport static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n    10\t\n    11\timport java.io.IOException;\n    12\timport java.net.InetSocketAddress;\n    13\timport java.net.Socket;\n    14\timport java.time.Duration;\n    15\timport java.util.concurrent.Callable;\n    16\timport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n    17\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.CompressionType;\n    18\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.Consumer;\n    19\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.Message;\n    20\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.MessageId;\n    21\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.Producer;\n    22\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.PulsarClient;\n    23\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.Schema;\n    24\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.SubscriptionInitialPosition;\n    25\timport org.apache.pulsar.common.schema.SchemaInfo;\n    26\timport org.apache.pulsar.common.schema.SchemaType;\n    27\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.AfterAll;\n    28\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeAll;\n    29\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\n    30\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.TestInstance;\n    31\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.Timeout;\n    32\t\n    33\t@TestInstance(TestInstance.Lifecycle.PER_CLASS)\n    34\t@Timeout(55)\n    35\tpublic class PulsarClientAllTest {\n    36\t    private static final String BROKER_HOST = \"127.0.0.1\";\n    37\t    private static final int BROKER_PORT = 6650;\n    38\t    private static final String BROKER_URL = \"pulsar://\" + BROKER_HOST + \":\" + BROKER_PORT;\n    39\t    private static final String CONTAINER_NAME = \"graalvm-pulsar-client-all-test\";\n    40\t    private static final String IMAGE = \"apachepulsar/pulsar:4.2.5\";\n    41\t    private static final Duration PROCESS_TIMEOUT = Duration.ofSeconds(20);\n    42\t    private static final Duration READINESS_TIMEOUT = Duration.ofSeconds(50);\n    43\t    private static final int OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 15;\n    44\t\n    45\t    private PulsarClient client;\n    46\t\n    47\t    @BeforeAll\n    48\t    void startPulsar() throws Exception {\n    49\t        removeExistingContainer();\n    50\t        try {\n    51\t            runDocker(\n    52\t                    true,\n    53\t                    \"run\",\n    54\t                    \"--detach\",\n    55\t                    \"--rm\",\n    56\t                    \"--name\",\n    57\t                    CONTAINER_NAME,\n    58\t                    \"-p\",\n    59\t                    \"6650:6650\",\n    60\t                    \"-p\",\n    61\t                    \"8080:8080\",\n    62\t                    IMAGE,\n    63\t                    \"bin/pulsar\",\n    64\t                    \"standalone\",\n    65\t                    \"--no-functions-worker\",\n    66\t                    \"--no-stream-storage\");\n    67\t            waitUntil(PulsarClientAllTest::brokerIsReady, READINESS_TIMEOUT);\n    68\t\n    69\t            client = PulsarClient.builder()\n    70\t                    .serviceUrl(BROKER_URL)\n    71\t                    .connectionTimeout(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n    72\t                    .operationTimeout(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n    73\t                    .lookupTimeout(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n    74\t                    .build();\n    75\t            waitUntil(\n    76\t                    () ->\n    77\t                            client.getPartitionsForTopic(topic(\"readiness\"))\n    78\t                                            .get(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n    79\t                                    != null,\n    80\t                    READINESS_TIMEOUT);\n    81\t        } catch (Exception e) {\n    82\t            runDocker(false, \"logs\", CONTAINER_NAME);\n    83\t            removeExistingContainer();\n    84\t            throw e;\n    85\t        }\n    86\t    }\n    87\t\n    88\t    @AfterAll\n    89\t    void stopPulsar() throws Exception {\n    90\t        try {\n    91\t            if (client != null) {\n    92\t                client.close();\n    93\t            }\n    94\t        } finally {\n    95\t            removeExistingContainer();\n    96\t        }\n    97\t    }\n    98\t\n    99\t    @Test\n   100\t    void publishesAndAcknowledgesStringMessage() throws Exception {\n   101\t        String topic = topic(\"strings\");\n   102\t        String subscription = \"string-subscription\";\n   103\t        try (Consumer<String> consumer = client.newConsumer(Schema.STRING)\n   104\t                        .topic(topic)\n   105\t                        .subscriptionName(subscription)\n   106\t                        .subscriptionInitialPosition(SubscriptionInitialPosition.Earliest)\n   107\t                        .subscribe();\n   108\t                Producer<String> producer = client.newProducer(Schema.STRING)\n   109\t                        .topic(topic)\n   110\t                        .producerName(\"string-producer\")\n   111\t                        .sendTimeout(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n   112\t                        .compressionType(CompressionType.LZ4)\n   113\t                        .create()) {\n   114\t            MessageId sentId = producer.newMessage()\n   115\t                    .key(\"order-7\")\n   116\t                    .property(\"source\", \"integration-test\")\n   117\t                    .eventTime(123456789L)\n   118\t                    .value(\"pulsar-message\")\n   119\t                    .sendAsync()\n   120\t                    .get(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n   121\t            Message<String> received =\n   122\t                    consumer.receive(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n   123\t\n   124\t            assertThat(sentId).isNotNull();\n   125\t            assertThat(received).isNotNull();\n   126\t            assertThat(received.getValue()).isEqualTo(\"pulsar-message\");\n   127\t            assertThat(received.getKey()).isEqualTo(\"order-7\");\n   128\t            assertThat(received.getProperty(\"source\")).isEqualTo(\"integration-test\");\n   129\t            assertThat(received.getEventTime()).isEqualTo(123456789L);\n   130\t            assertThat(received.getTopicName()).isEqualTo(topic);\n   131\t\n   132\t            consumer.acknowledge(received);\n   133\t            assertThat(consumer.isConnected()).isTrue();\n   134\t            assertThat(producer.isConnected()).isTrue();\n   135\t        }\n   136\t    }\n   137\t\n   138\t    @Test\n   139\t    void exchangesJsonMessageWithCompressionAndRegisteredSchema() throws Exception {\n   140\t        String topic = topic(\"json\");\n   141\t        Schema<PurchaseOrder> schema = Schema.JSON(PurchaseOrder.class);\n   142\t        try (Consumer<PurchaseOrder> consumer = client.newConsumer(schema)\n   143\t                        .topic(topic)\n   144\t                        .subscriptionName(\"json-subscription\")\n   145\t                        .subscriptionInitialPosition(SubscriptionInitialPosition.Earliest)\n   146\t                        .subscribe();\n   147\t                Producer<PurchaseOrder> producer = client.newProducer(schema)\n   148\t                        .topic(topic)\n   149\t                        .producerName(\"json-producer\")\n   150\t                        .sendTimeout(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n   151\t                        .compressionType(CompressionType.ZSTD)\n   152\t                        .enableBatching(false)\n   153\t                        .create()) {\n   154\t            PurchaseOrder order = new PurchaseOrder(\"purchase-42\", 3);\n   155\t            producer.send(order);\n   156\t\n   157\t            Message<PurchaseOrder> received =\n   158\t                    consumer.receive(OPERATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n   159\t            SchemaInfo schemaInfo = schema.getSchemaInfo();\n   160\t\n   161\t            assertThat(received).isNotNull();\n   162\t            assertThat(received.getValue().getOrderId()).isEqualTo(\"purchase-42\");\n   163\t            assertThat(received.getValue().getUnits()).isEqualTo(3);\n   164\t            assertThat(schemaInfo.getType()).isEqualTo(SchemaType.JSON);\n   165\t            assertThat(schemaInfo.getSchemaDefinition()).contains(\"orderId\", \"units\");\n   166\t\n   167\t            consumer.acknowledge(received);\n   168\t        }\n   169\t    }\n   170\t\n   171\t    private static String topic(String suffix) {\n   172\t        return \"persistent://public/default/graalvm-client-all-\" + suffix;\n   173\t    }\n   174\t\n   175\t    private static boolean brokerIsReady() throws IOException {\n   176\t        try (Socket socket = new Socket()) {\n   177\t            socket.connect(new InetSocketAddress(BROKER_HOST, BROKER_PORT), 10_000);\n   178\t            return true;\n   179\t        }\n   180\t    }\n   181\t\n   182\t    private static void waitUntil(Callable<Boolean> condition, Duration timeout)\n   183\t            throws Exception {\n   184\t        Exception lastException = null;\n   185\t        long deadline = System.nanoTime() + timeout.toNanos();\n   186\t        while (System.nanoTime() < deadline) {\n   187\t            try {\n   188\t                if (condition.call()) {\n   189\t                    return;\n   190\t                }\n   191\t            } catch (Exception e) {\n   192\t                lastException = e;\n   193\t            }\n   194\t            try {\n   195\t                Thread.sleep(1_000L);\n   196\t            } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n   197\t                Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n   198\t                throw new IllegalStateException(\"Interrupted while waiting for Pulsar\", e);\n   199\t            }\n   200\t        }\n   201\t        String message = \"Pulsar did not become ready within \" + timeout;\n   202\t        throw lastException == null\n   203\t                ? new IllegalStateException(message)\n   204\t                : new IllegalStateException(message, lastException);\n   205\t    }\n   206\t\n   207\t    private static void removeExistingContainer() throws Exception {\n   208\t        runDocker(false, \"rm\", \"--force\", CONTAINER_NAME);\n   209\t    }\n   210\t\n   211\t    private static void runDocker(boolean requireSuccess, String... arguments)\n   212\t            throws Exception {\n   213\t        String[] command = new String[arguments.length + 1];\n   214\t        command[0] = \"docker\";\n   215\t        System.arraycopy(arguments, 0, command, 1, arguments.length);\n   216\t        Process process = new ProcessBuilder(command).inheritIO().start();\n   217\t        if (!process.waitFor(PROCESS_TIMEOUT.toMillis(), TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS)) {\n   218\t            process.destroyForcibly();\n   219\t            process.waitFor(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n   220\t            throw new IllegalStateException(\n   221\t                    \"Docker command timed out: \" + String.join(\" \", command));\n   222\t        }\n   223\t        if (requireSuccess && process.exitValue() != 0) {\n   224\t            throw new IllegalStateException(\n   225\t                    \"Docker command failed with exit code \"\n   226\t                            + process.exitValue()\n   227\t                            + \": \"\n   228\t                            + String.join(\" \", command));\n   229\t        }\n   230\t    }\n   231\t\n   232\t    public static final class PurchaseOrder {\n   233\t        private String orderId;\n   234\t        private int units;\n   235\t\n   236\t        public PurchaseOrder() { }\n   237\t\n   238\t        public PurchaseOrder(String orderId, int units) {\n   239\t            this.orderId = orderId;\n   240\t            this.units = units;\n   241\t        }\n   242\t\n   243\t        public String getOrderId() {\n   244\t            return orderId;\n   245\t        }\n   246\t\n   247\t        public void setOrderId(String orderId) {\n   248\t            this.orderId = orderId;\n   249\t        }\n   250\t\n   251\t        public int getUnits() {\n   252\t            return units;\n   253\t        }\n   254\t\n   255\t        public void setUnits(int units) {\n   256\t            this.units = units;\n   257\t        }\n   258\t    }\n   259\t}\n\n--- auth ---\n     1\t/*\n     2\t * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n     3\t *\n     4\t * You should have received a copy of the CC0 legalcode along with this\n     5\t * work. If not, see <http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>.\n     6\t */\n     7\tpackage org_apache_pulsar.pulsar_client_all;\n     8\t\n     9\timport static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n    10\t\n    11\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.Authentication;\n    12\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.AuthenticationDataProvider;\n    13\timport org.apache.pulsar.client.api.AuthenticationFactory;\n    14\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\n    15\timport org.junit.jupiter.api.Timeout;\n    16\t\n    17\t@Timeout(55)\n    18\tpublic class AuthenticationUtilTest {\n    19\t    private static final String TOKEN_PLUGIN_CLASS =\n    20\t            \"org.apache.pulsar.client.impl.auth.AuthenticationToken\";\n    21\t\n    22\t    @Test\n    23\t    void createsAndConfiguresTokenAuthenticationPlugin() throws Exception {\n    24\t        String token = \"spring-pulsar-token\";\n    25\t\n    26\t        try (Authentication authentication =\n    27\t                AuthenticationFactory.create(TOKEN_PLUGIN_CLASS, token)) {\n    28\t            authentication.start();\n    29\t            AuthenticationDataProvider authenticationData = authentication.getAuthData();\n    30\t\n    31\t            assertThat(authentication.getAuthMethodName()).isEqualTo(\"token\");\n    32\t            assertThat(authenticationData.hasDataFromCommand()).isTrue();\n    33\t            assertThat(authenticationData.getCommandData()).isEqualTo(token);\n    34\t        }\n    35\t    }\n    36\t}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791933361092}}
