 heap space` after building a 282.75 MiB dynamic-access image. In contrast, `human-intervention-logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-all:4.2.5/style-checks/test-2026-10-13T23-06-31-322976Z.log` shows all four generated tests passing on Native Image, and the final Checkstyle run also passes.\n\nDynamic-access coverage remains unavailable because repeated `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` attempts failed with `Some project locks have not been unlocked`; inspect `human-intervention-logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-all:4.2.5/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-13T22-45-31-730162Z.log`. Consequently, `stats/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/execution-metrics.json` records failure after 5 iterations with zeroed LOC, metadata, and coverage fields.\n\n1. Resolve the Gradle project-lock/daemon issue and rerun `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` until it produces the coverage JSON.\n2. Rerun `generateLibraryStats` with sufficient Gradle heap, or diagnose its memory usage for this large shaded artifact, and confirm valid nonzero stats.\n3. Review the preserved generated tests and metadata, then rerun coordinate-scoped `checkMetadataFiles`, `checkstyle`, `spotlessCheck`, and `test` before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_022045da9768fdeb016acebc0212f487d1a8bbb9e41fce9264\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1189, "output": 1440, "cacheRead": 204800, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 954, "totalTokens": 207429, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791933416002, "responseId": "resp_022045da9768fdeb016acebbe8680887d1806b349e0936312a", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
